      "text": "19. Dunnathala Yallareddy,, S/O. Narayanareddy, Aged\n About 40 Years R/O. Malinenipatnam Village, Atloor\n Mandal, Kadapa District.\n ...Petitioner(S)\n And\n1. G Srinivasulu Ias, The Special Collector, Galeru\n Nagari Srujala Sravanti Project, New\n Collectorate,Kadapa District.\n 3\n 2. Sri A Venkatesu, The Special Deputy Collector, Land\n Acquisition,Unit-11,Telugu Ganga Project,\n ...Contemnor(S):\n Petition under Sections 10 to 12 of Contempt of Courts Act 1971 praying\nthat in the circumstances stated in the affidavit file herein the High Court may\nbe pleased to may be pleased to punish the Respondents under Sec. 10 to\n12 of Contempt of Court Act, 1971 for willful, wanton, disobedience of the\norders of this Hon'ble High Court dated 05.03.2024 passed in W.P.No.5722\nof 2024 by the Hon'ble Lordships, and pass such\nIa No: 1 Of 2025\n Petition under Section 151 Cpc praying that in the circumstances stated\nin the affidavit filed in support of the petition, the High Court may be pleased\nDunnathala Narayana vs G Srinivasulu Ias on 2 December, 2025\nIndian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/134821454/\n2\n\npleased to permit the petitioner to implead the proposed respondent no. 3 in\nCc No. 455 of 2025 and also pending miscellaneous petitions therein, on the\nfile of this Hon'ble High Court and pass\nCounsel for the Petitioner(S):\n 1. Vallepu Jagadeesh\nCounsel for the Contemnor(S):\n 1. A Jayanthi\n 4\n The Honourable Sri Justice Tarlada Rajasekhar Rao\n Contempt Case No.455 of 2025\nOrder:",
